WEBVTT

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:03.548
This fictional task prepares an answer, obtains review

00:00:03.862 --> 00:00:07.411
and simulates a permitted send. Choose a procedure

00:00:07.591 --> 00:00:10.041
because the steps must happen in order. A

00:00:10.086 --> 00:00:13.051
checklist suits repeated checks; a decision guide suits

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.688
branching choices; a template suits consistent inputs; a

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:20.057
knowledge note suits reference information. The chosen procedure

00:00:20.102 --> 00:00:23.495
applies only to supplied practice material. Keep real

00:00:23.719 --> 00:00:27.267
sending outside the exercise. Record why the format

00:00:27.313 --> 00:00:29.782
fits the task and identify the tested map

00:00:30.007 --> 00:00:31.747
and sample evidence behind it.
